 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That is Edom in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took his wives from the daughters of Canaan",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Adah and Oholibamah and Basemath came",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Their possessions were too great to live together",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land could not support their livestock",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Esau settled in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Esau is Edom the father of the Edomites",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Iram stands in the list of the chiefs",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These were the chiefs of Edom",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to their settlements in the land they possessed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This was Esau the father of the Edomites",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By their clans and their regions name by name",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Timna and Chief Alvah are known",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Oholibamah and Chief Elah too",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Pinon and Chief Kenaz appear",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These are the chiefs descended from Esau",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the land they possessed and held",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The genealogy confirms his position there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Among the tribal chiefs of the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Iram stands in the list of the chiefs",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These were the chiefs of Edom",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to their settlements in the land they possessed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This was Esau the father of the Edomites",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the book of Chronicles the name is repeated",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Magdiel and Chief Iram are listed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Confirming his place in the tribal structure",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The spread of Esau\u2019s descendants is seen",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
